        "problem": "Simplify $4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)+4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}\u2061(2x).$",
        "worked_solution": "First, we factor the $4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)+4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}\u2061(2x) & =4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}\u2061(2x))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta ={csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}\u2061(2x)) & =4{csc}^{2}\u2061(2x)\\cdot {csc}^{2}\u2061(2x) \\\\  & =4{csc}^{4}\u2061(2x).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
